abstract: "Real ocean acidification planetary-boundary science (Findlay et al. 2025, Global Change Biology: boundary crossed globally, ~40% surface / ~60% subsurface to 200m) including the boundary metric's own active scientific revision (Findlay & Feely 2026, National Science Review: the original 80% threshold doesn't satisfy its own justifying criteria). Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge -- see DISCLAIMER.md. GenesisAeon P122."
